---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const title = "Privacy Policy";
const description = "Our commitment to your privacy and data protection.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-white mb-2">
        Privacy Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-white/60">
        Last updated: January 25, 2026
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg text-white/90 max-w-none">
      <p>
        Your privacy is important to us. We are committed to protecting your data
        and being transparent about our practices.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 mb-3">No Personal Data Collection</h2>
      <p>
        We do <strong>not</strong> collect any personal data from our users. We do
        not ask for or store your name, email address, or any other personally
        identifiable information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 mb-3">Anonymous Crash Logs</h2>
      <p>
        The only data we collect are anonymous crash logs, which help us improve
        the stability and performance of our website. These logs do not contain
        any information that can identify you personally.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 mb-3">Information We Collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Anonymous Crash Logs:</strong> Non-identifiable error data used
          solely to diagnose and fix issues.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-10 mb-3">How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To maintain and improve the reliability and security of our website</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="mt-10 mb-3">Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        We use cookies and similar tracking technologies to enhance your
        experience. These do not collect personal data. You can control cookie
        preferences in your browser settings.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 mb-3">Data Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell, rent, or share any personal information, as we do not
        collect any. Anonymous crash logs may be processed by trusted service
        providers solely to help us improve our website.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 mb-3">Data Security</h2>
      <p>
        We implement reasonable security measures to protect all data, including
        anonymous logs. However, no method of transmission over the Internet is
        100% secure.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 mb-3">Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Since we do not collect personal data, there is no personal information
        to access, correct, or delete. If you have any concerns, please contact us.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 mb-3">Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be
        posted on this page with an updated effective date.
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-10 mb-3">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>
        If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at
        <a href="mailto:hello@ectoapp.uk">hello@ectoapp.uk</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>